# Walkthrough: Event-First Orchestration Activation

> **Date:** 2026-01-08 11:33 IST  
> **Result:** ✅ Success  

---

## What Was Done

### Root Cause Identified

**Problem:** 80% of Nucleus orchestration was dormant  
**Root Cause:** Infrastructure-first design (event stream exists but applications don't emit)  
**Solution:** Instrument core functions with automatic event emission

