## Event Stream Status

**Total Events:** 202+  
**Active Event Types:** 10+  

**Sample Events Flowing:**
- `task_created` - When tasks added
- `task_state_changed` - When status changes (PENDING→IN_PROGRESS→DONE)
- `commitment_created` - When loops/commitments added
- `commitment_closed` - When commitments closed
- `health_status` - From health check script
- `deploy_complete` - When deploys finish
- `session_saved` - When context saved
- `depth_increased/decreased` - Depth tracker

